    "description": "Shotgun Sights: Laffs\n\nA taller variant of the Laffs PDW Sights V2 for use with shotguns that have in-line stocks such as Kel-Tec KSG and KS7 Gen 2, S&W M&P12, \nStandard Manufacturing DP-12, IWI TS-12, and SRM Arms Model 1216. Has a 6mm aperture windage adjustable sight, with a fixed blade front sight.\n\n\n\nPrinter Used: Ender 3 V2\n\nFilament Used: PLA+\n\nPrint Settings:\n\nExtruder: 220C \nBed: 56C \nFirst Layer Print Height: .20mm \nStandard Layer Height: .14mm\nWall Thickness: .40mm\nWall Perimeters: 5+\nInfill: 40%+\nSupport Material Percentage: 16%\n\nPrint the front and rear sight mounts on their front facets.\n\n\n\nHardware Needed: \n\n1x M4x30 Hex Socketed Machine Screw/Bolt\n\n1x M4 Hex Nut (Be sure both bolt & nut are the same thread pitch.)\n\n1x M2x10 Set Screw (For locking the windage adjustable rear sight)\n",
